WEBVTT

00:43.668 --> 00:48.423
DOONA!

02:05.500 --> 02:10.296
EPISODE 1
AN UNEXPECTED TWIST

02:15.802 --> 02:19.681
KOOK'S SEAFOOD HOUSE

02:30.066 --> 02:31.943
KOOK'S SEAFOOD HOUSE
CEO KOOK SU-JIN

02:33.319 --> 02:35.488
So I, um, made business cards.

02:35.572 --> 02:38.032
Ooh.

02:38.116 --> 02:40.577
I'm super jealous.
Twenty-one and a CEO already.

02:40.660 --> 02:43.079
Now that you're the boss,
you can pick your hours, huh?

02:43.163 --> 02:45.456
Maybe you could help my mom.
Her back is pretty bad.

02:45.540 --> 02:48.668
If you're so worried about your mother,
then why you moving all the way to Seoul?

02:49.169 --> 02:51.671
The drive to school from here
has been a lot.

02:51.754 --> 02:53.798
Now that my sister isn't in the hospital,

02:54.674 --> 02:57.385
I can live closer to school
and utilize that time better.

02:59.429 --> 03:00.555
Hey, Kooksu.

03:01.806 --> 03:02.807
Thank you.

03:03.391 --> 03:04.809
Take care of my mom, you hear?

03:04.893 --> 03:06.352
Don't worry about it, okay?

03:10.565 --> 03:13.985
If, by any chance, while you're in Seoul,
you happen to see Doona,

03:14.068 --> 03:15.737
dude, you gotta call me, all right?

03:15.820 --> 03:18.114
Yeah, right.
Like that would ever happen.

03:18.198 --> 03:20.992
WHEN THE ANSWERS INCLUDE
VERBS AND NON-VERBS

03:21.075 --> 03:24.787
Verbs are in the middle.
Nouns are… in front.

03:25.830 --> 03:27.582
Oh, sorry about that.

04:05.328 --> 04:06.913
LOVE AND DO WHAT YOU WILL

04:22.262 --> 04:23.388
Hello there.

05:04.262 --> 05:06.264
Oh.

05:06.931 --> 05:07.765
It worked.

05:21.821 --> 05:25.616
Hey, uh, you look familiar.
Do we know each other at all?

05:29.370 --> 05:30.955
Oh, uh, I guess not.

05:32.165 --> 05:35.001
I think I had you confused
with someone I once knew.

05:36.753 --> 05:37.795
I'm sorry about that.

05:38.796 --> 05:41.341
Ah, just so you know,
I'm the new tenant on the second floor.

05:41.424 --> 05:42.759
I hope we become great neighbors.

05:42.842 --> 05:45.428
This is actually the first time
that I have left home.

06:04.989 --> 06:06.949
PLEASE KNOCK

06:07.617 --> 06:08.493
Oh.

06:12.663 --> 06:14.540
Hi, I'm Lee Won-jun.
I'm the new tenant upstairs.

06:14.624 --> 06:16.751
Here. Please review the house rules.

06:17.502 --> 06:18.669
HOUSE RULES

06:18.753 --> 06:20.713
Specifically, number seven,
the laundry guidelines.

06:22.340 --> 06:25.718
Since you're upstairs,
you do your laundry on the rooftop, okay?

06:29.013 --> 06:31.557
- Is that clear?
- Yes, it is. It's very clear, sir.

06:40.691 --> 06:41.567
Oh.

06:42.985 --> 06:44.862
- Newbie?
- Uh, yes.

06:44.946 --> 06:47.448
- It's really nice to meet--
- I'm a senior and a psych major.

06:48.116 --> 06:50.243
Taek, Taek, I'm Yun-taek.

06:51.285 --> 06:52.453
Seo Yun-taek.

06:53.246 --> 06:56.666
Okay, cool. So I'm Lee Won-jun,
second year, civil engineering.

06:56.749 --> 06:59.836
You have nothing to worry about here,
so let's just say

06:59.919 --> 07:01.462
you can just be yourself, freely.

07:01.546 --> 07:02.922
Live free, Won-jun.

07:03.464 --> 07:04.298
Okay?

07:04.382 --> 07:05.216
Uh-huh.

07:05.925 --> 07:06.843
Ah.

07:07.468 --> 07:08.302
Welcome.

07:14.308 --> 07:15.435
Huh?

07:15.518 --> 07:16.602
Oh jeez.

07:56.017 --> 07:58.603
Whoa! Ah! No, wait!
Don't fall. Don't fall.

07:58.686 --> 07:59.812
Where are you going, huh?

08:01.022 --> 08:03.065
- Oh jeez.
- Ah!

08:03.149 --> 08:06.027
Ay! Oh! Oh!

08:06.110 --> 08:08.321
Ow! Ow! What the heck?

08:08.821 --> 08:11.365
Oh! Ah! Ah!

08:25.379 --> 08:26.756
This goes here.

08:27.924 --> 08:28.799
There we go.

08:35.097 --> 08:36.307
This looks great.

08:42.480 --> 08:44.273
Organic pumpkin, huh?

08:58.454 --> 09:01.040
MINSONG NATIONAL UNIVERSITY
CIVIL ENGINEERING TOP SCHOLAR

09:01.123 --> 09:04.377
TUTOR

09:26.399 --> 09:27.525
Ah!

09:39.078 --> 09:40.913
KOREAN TUTOR
MINSONG KOR LIT FRESHMAN

09:41.747 --> 09:43.291
Look, there's still some left.

09:44.333 --> 09:45.459
Oh, that's great.

09:46.210 --> 09:47.628
- Here you go.
- Thank you.

09:48.379 --> 09:49.255
Hmm.

09:49.463 --> 09:51.173
Hey, do you see that boy's hoodie?

09:51.257 --> 09:54.051
He must be a superfan, huh?
Why would he wear that outside?

09:54.135 --> 09:56.304
- It's kind of cute, right?
- Obviously, cute.

10:41.015 --> 10:43.726
THERE'S A STALKER ON THE SECOND FLOOR

11:19.720 --> 11:20.763
KOOK SU-JIN

11:21.722 --> 11:22.598
Kooksu, what is it?

11:22.682 --> 11:24.642
Hey, bro!

11:24.725 --> 11:26.936
Get ready to bow and kiss my feet, bro!

11:27.019 --> 11:28.145
Kiss your feet?

11:29.313 --> 11:31.857
Someone's willing to pay
800,000 won for tutoring?

11:31.941 --> 11:33.359
Yeah, isn't that great?

11:33.442 --> 11:35.236
Every month and that's just for math.

11:35.319 --> 11:36.445
Isn't this freaking sweet?

11:36.529 --> 11:38.197
Uh, yeah. Can't believe it at all.

11:38.280 --> 11:41.117
That amount will cover
all of my rent and living expenses.

11:41.200 --> 11:43.285
CEO Kooksu, I don't know how to thank you.

11:43.369 --> 11:45.621
Can you please thank your mom for me
for the referral?

11:45.705 --> 11:47.707
How's your place, huh? Is it nice?

11:51.544 --> 11:53.671
What? Wait, what?

11:58.676 --> 12:01.554
That's how much I love you, Doona!
I'm in love with you, okay? Yeah!

12:01.637 --> 12:03.681
- Jeez. What the hell?
- Whoo!

12:03.764 --> 12:06.600
Didn't you say you threw their albums out
because you were done with them.

12:07.309 --> 12:10.396
It's not easy giving up
on something you love so much.

12:10.479 --> 12:11.731
Oh, Won-jun, hey.

12:11.814 --> 12:14.233
For your information,
I lent you that hoodie, remember?

12:14.316 --> 12:15.651
And I want it back, you hear?

12:15.735 --> 12:17.445
It was a limited-edition item.

12:17.528 --> 12:19.238
Doona won't have
new merch now for a while.

12:19.321 --> 12:20.740
Wait a second. What hoodie?

12:21.240 --> 12:23.159
You mean my birthday present for you?

12:25.119 --> 12:26.120
Uh, seriously?

12:26.203 --> 12:28.289
I was wearing this all day yesterday.

12:28.372 --> 12:30.624
What? You wore it out? Bro!

12:30.708 --> 12:33.878
READ
THERE'S A STALKER ON THE SECOND FLOOR

13:01.655 --> 13:02.823
What's your deal?

13:06.869 --> 13:08.370
Now I remember!

13:10.915 --> 13:12.958
You're Lee Doona! Dream Sweet!

13:13.042 --> 13:14.668
I just figured out who you were.

13:15.961 --> 13:18.255
- You really expect me to believe that?
- What?

13:18.339 --> 13:19.924
Sorry, but what did you mean by that?

13:23.636 --> 13:25.721
Would you stop the acting?
Seriously! You're a joke!

13:25.805 --> 13:26.931
Whoa!

13:29.225 --> 13:31.393
Oh! Are you insane?
That could've really hurt!

13:32.478 --> 13:34.146
Wow, you act like a child.

13:34.230 --> 13:35.397
What's that?

13:35.481 --> 13:38.192
- So how did you know I live here, huh?
- Well, I didn't.

13:39.068 --> 13:41.111
Where's your spy cam?
It's around here, right?

13:42.154 --> 13:43.656
What are you hoping to see?

13:45.032 --> 13:47.409
You're here 'cause you're stalking me,
isn't that right?

13:47.493 --> 13:49.787
Listen, I'm not a stalker. I swear.

13:49.870 --> 13:53.123
I have a friend who's a superfan.
That's why I recognize you. I promise.

13:54.500 --> 13:56.710
Look, I'm sorry. I'll stop talking.

14:02.633 --> 14:03.843
And just so you know,

14:04.635 --> 14:06.220
TWICE is my favorite band. TWICE.

14:15.771 --> 14:17.314
MOM

14:17.398 --> 14:19.859
DECLINE - ACCEPT

14:26.115 --> 14:29.618
In terms of math, I'm certain
you won't find a tutor that's better.

14:29.702 --> 14:32.705
And my expertise
is a result of my experience as a tutor.

14:32.788 --> 14:34.331
I'm truly confident.

14:36.458 --> 14:38.669
I think you're quite earnest, hmm?
I appreciate that.

14:40.129 --> 14:43.132
Then, um, can I start
the tutoring lessons next week?

14:44.008 --> 14:44.967
Mm-hmm.

14:47.887 --> 14:49.305
- Oh, Mr. Lee!
- Yes?

14:50.306 --> 14:53.559
You, uh… you forgot this.

14:53.642 --> 14:55.603
Oh. Thank you very much.

15:05.613 --> 15:08.699
MINSONG NATIONAL UNIVERSITY
PREVIEW

15:11.493 --> 15:13.245
MATH TUTOR

15:14.413 --> 15:15.956
Excuse me. Are you looking for a…

15:18.667 --> 15:20.044
Oh, Won-jun, hey.

15:26.717 --> 15:29.178
It's been a while, hasn't it, Jin-ju?

15:37.394 --> 15:38.562
Ah. Mmm.

15:38.646 --> 15:41.148
I almost didn't recognize you
because your hair is much shorter.

15:41.231 --> 15:44.068
Oh, really?
It's been like this for over a year.

15:47.071 --> 15:48.989
- Exactly.
- Ah.

15:49.073 --> 15:51.700
Um, uh, I know
we haven't seen each other for a while.

15:54.912 --> 15:57.456
Uh, for the record,
short hair suits you well.

15:58.082 --> 16:01.168
So where are you staying?
Are you still commuting here?

16:01.251 --> 16:04.254
I was until last year.
Now I share a co-ed house nearby.

16:04.338 --> 16:05.631
Ah.

16:07.091 --> 16:09.551
Oh, that's too bad.
I thought we could ride here together.

16:10.469 --> 16:12.054
Round trip, it's five hours.

16:12.137 --> 16:13.973
I'll probably go crazy commuting alone.

16:14.556 --> 16:15.432
What do you mean?

16:15.933 --> 16:17.643
I got into Minsong too.

16:20.062 --> 16:21.355
Hey!

16:21.438 --> 16:23.315
I finally got in. Where's the congrats?

16:23.399 --> 16:24.942
Oh, right. Uh…

16:25.651 --> 16:27.528
Cheers!

16:30.447 --> 16:32.241
It's snowing.

16:41.000 --> 16:42.793
- It's so chilly.
- Uh…

16:42.876 --> 16:44.586
Mmm.

16:46.630 --> 16:48.882
- Here.
- Oh, uh, are you sure?

16:48.966 --> 16:51.176
Take it. It's cold. And it's snowing too.

16:52.678 --> 16:54.179
All right. Thank you.

16:58.475 --> 17:00.728
Nice to know you're still a sweet guy.

17:05.399 --> 17:06.817
Mmm, that's mine.

17:10.571 --> 17:11.822
And that's mine.

17:11.905 --> 17:12.990
KOREAN TUTOR FOR CSAT

17:13.073 --> 17:14.616
Oh, so you're the competition then.

17:14.700 --> 17:16.452
We've always been competitors, haven't we?

17:16.535 --> 17:18.203
Even though I've never won yet.

17:23.625 --> 17:24.585
Hmm.

17:27.629 --> 17:29.423
Anyway, how about we
get together more often

17:29.506 --> 17:30.799
since we're at the same school?

17:30.883 --> 17:31.967
Mmm, I'd like that.

17:32.051 --> 17:33.385
Hmm.

17:34.970 --> 17:36.221
Oh, that's my bus.

17:38.057 --> 17:39.808
I'll see you later.

18:03.457 --> 18:04.374
Hmm.

18:07.836 --> 18:10.214
KOREAN TUTOR FOR CSAT
MINSONG KOR LIT FRESHMAN

18:55.926 --> 18:57.719
Is she okay in this cold?

19:25.372 --> 19:26.874
- Hey!
- Uh, yes?

19:35.507 --> 19:37.217
Don't ever sing my song again.

19:38.260 --> 19:39.887
Just so you know,
you're a horrible singer.

19:42.598 --> 19:45.434
If you so much as hum a lyric
of my song ever again, I'll…

19:45.517 --> 19:47.644
I'm gonna have to smash your head in.
You got it?

19:47.728 --> 19:49.021
Hmm, smash my head?

19:56.904 --> 19:57.988
Whoa! Oh!

19:58.614 --> 19:59.740
Uh, hey.

19:59.823 --> 20:01.408
Can you hear me? Are you okay?

20:09.416 --> 20:12.336
Uh, hi.
I'm at 21 Minsongdae Road.

20:12.419 --> 20:14.129
Someone passed out here.
She's unconscious.

20:15.047 --> 20:16.632
Please get here as soon as you can.

20:16.715 --> 20:18.759
Please hurry. Get here quickly.

20:19.259 --> 20:20.552
Yes, thank you. Yes.

20:48.288 --> 20:49.623
JOB HUNTING STUDY GROUP

20:49.706 --> 20:52.584
Is this applicable only to seniors?

20:54.253 --> 20:55.504
- Hey.
- Oh!

20:55.587 --> 20:57.756
Oh! You're awake.

20:57.839 --> 20:59.258
You're at the hospital right now.

21:00.968 --> 21:03.845
Oh, the, uh… the nurse
asked for you emergency contact earlier.

21:06.098 --> 21:07.224
I've got nobody.

21:10.060 --> 21:10.978
Well,

21:12.521 --> 21:14.439
you really should call your family, then.

21:15.440 --> 21:16.692
There's nobody, dude.

21:17.484 --> 21:19.736
Uh, how about your… manager, or--

21:19.820 --> 21:21.238
There's fucking nobody, okay?

21:27.703 --> 21:29.579
How come you're swearing?
People are around.

21:29.663 --> 21:30.956
Yeah, what's your point?

21:31.456 --> 21:33.625
- You don't swear at all?
- No, I don't at all.

21:34.459 --> 21:36.586
I'm also not a celebrity, unlike someone.

21:37.462 --> 21:38.797
Yeah, well, I'm not now either.

21:46.430 --> 21:49.057
Miss Lee Doona, is your next of kin here?

21:50.851 --> 21:52.102
Miss Lee Doona.

21:52.811 --> 21:55.063
Uh, so… so I'm her sibling, actually.

21:55.147 --> 21:56.898
You can speak to me about everything.

21:56.982 --> 21:58.567
Could you please come with me, then?

22:04.448 --> 22:08.243
Thanks to your quick action,
there are no complications at this time.

22:08.327 --> 22:11.038
However, her body temperature
is a bit on the low side,

22:11.121 --> 22:14.666
so please make sure her head,
hands, and feet always stay warm.

22:14.750 --> 22:17.461
Have her use a dry blanket,
and most importantly,

22:17.544 --> 22:19.838
make sure she always
has socks on her feet.

22:19.921 --> 22:23.216
Having her drink warm beverages
will also help the recovery process.

22:23.300 --> 22:24.343
Okay, got it.

22:24.426 --> 22:27.971
Oh, also, could she be having
any internal problems at all?

22:28.472 --> 22:30.640
Do you know
if she'll need other prognostic testing?

22:30.724 --> 22:33.727
No, no further tests
are required at this time.

22:33.810 --> 22:37.397
Oh, sorry, do you have
a phone charger I maybe could borrow?

22:37.481 --> 22:39.983
- Uh, just a moment.
- Thank you.

22:50.952 --> 22:52.162
They said you needed socks.

22:54.831 --> 22:57.250
- I'd prefer if you put them on for me.
- I should?

22:58.293 --> 22:59.544
You're my sibling.

23:02.297 --> 23:03.298
Um, right.

23:11.098 --> 23:12.307
Okay, just bear with me.

23:27.572 --> 23:30.200
It'll be just a little longer. Sorry.

23:33.912 --> 23:35.330
Huh?

23:39.376 --> 23:41.336
They didn't have
any normal sleeping socks?

23:41.420 --> 23:42.295
What's that?

23:42.379 --> 23:45.006
You couldn't find proper bed socks
that were more plain?

23:45.590 --> 23:47.717
I prefer my belongings to look ordinary.

23:49.469 --> 23:50.595
What's funny?

23:51.221 --> 23:52.597
Um, oh, nothing.

23:54.266 --> 23:56.560
You claim you prefer ordinary things,
but it's strange

23:56.643 --> 23:58.687
because you're not
an ordinary girl at all.

24:00.021 --> 24:03.817
Did you know… sleeping socks sometimes
make you sweat more during the night?

24:04.401 --> 24:05.819
That can make you feel colder.

24:05.902 --> 24:07.487
So these will be better for you.

24:07.571 --> 24:09.614
Anyway, the other socks were
old-men socks,

24:09.698 --> 24:10.991
so pink was the best option.

24:21.418 --> 24:24.004
So, by the way, what's your name,
my fake sibling?

24:24.087 --> 24:25.088
Who, me?

24:30.177 --> 24:32.804
Uh, that's personal information.

24:50.238 --> 24:52.657
KOOK SU-JIN

24:54.659 --> 24:55.911
Hey, Kooksu.

24:55.994 --> 24:58.246
Hey, when did you begin smoking?

24:58.330 --> 24:59.247
Huh?

24:59.956 --> 25:01.166
I don't smoke, okay?

25:01.666 --> 25:02.709
Why do you ask?

25:02.792 --> 25:06.421
My mom's friend said to tell you
to forget about the tutoring gig.

25:08.381 --> 25:09.799
- What?
- You jackass!

25:09.883 --> 25:12.344
She asked me to confirm
that you're not a smoker three times,

25:12.427 --> 25:13.887
I told her you don't over and over.

25:13.970 --> 25:16.139
But then, she told me
she had picked up your scarf,

25:16.223 --> 25:17.641
and it reeked of cigarettes.

25:30.820 --> 25:32.197
I can't believe this happened.

25:32.906 --> 25:34.491
All that money just gone.

25:44.209 --> 25:46.795
YOUR ITEM HAS BEEN DELIVERED

25:58.515 --> 25:59.933
Hi, Won-jun.

26:03.895 --> 26:05.564
Did you have breakfast yet?

26:05.647 --> 26:07.566
If not,
why don't we share a meal together?

26:07.649 --> 26:11.361
Wait, uh…
Hey, is that my package by any chance?

26:14.030 --> 26:15.031
Oh.

26:20.078 --> 26:20.996
What did you buy, huh?

26:21.079 --> 26:23.206
It's something super cushy, right?

26:23.290 --> 26:25.584
No, but why would you sit
on someone else's package?

26:25.667 --> 26:28.587
Oh, I'm starving right now.
So what should we get?

26:28.670 --> 26:30.046
I'm going inside now.

26:37.262 --> 26:38.096
Hmm?

26:41.224 --> 26:43.810
And that was the day
she started waiting for me.

26:50.358 --> 26:53.194
- Oh!
- Hi, Won-jun. Have you had breakfast yet?

26:53.278 --> 26:55.280
There's a tteokbokki place.
Let's go, yeah?

26:56.948 --> 26:57.866
Hey, Won-jun!

27:01.202 --> 27:03.663
Let's share a combo meal.

27:03.747 --> 27:06.041
Won-jun! Come on! Let's eat!

27:19.763 --> 27:21.389
She's driving me crazy.

27:26.603 --> 27:28.063
Oh, crap, she's here.

27:28.146 --> 27:29.481
Good evening.

27:32.275 --> 27:33.276
Uh, good evening.

27:33.360 --> 27:36.655
If you're here to do some laundry,
go ahead. Don't mind me.

28:02.055 --> 28:03.056
Uh…

28:12.440 --> 28:15.026
Oh! Uh, oh, this?

28:15.110 --> 28:17.278
I had bought this for my friend
as his birthday present.

28:17.362 --> 28:19.197
He let me borrow it,
but I need to return it.

28:19.280 --> 28:21.825
And I only had it on that day
because it was super cold

28:21.908 --> 28:23.451
and the fleece lining kept me warm.

28:23.535 --> 28:24.411
Was I speaking?

28:24.494 --> 28:26.788
- I don't want you to get the wrong idea.
- I won't.

28:26.871 --> 28:29.999
You said you're not a fan.
So you're not a fan.

28:39.134 --> 28:41.594
You dress well
for a civil engineering major, you know?

28:42.512 --> 28:44.723
Does your girlfriend
help you choose your outfits?

28:44.806 --> 28:46.349
No, I don't have one yet.

28:49.352 --> 28:51.938
I'm hungry. Should we grab something?

28:54.774 --> 28:57.569
Um… well, there's something
I wanna ask first.

28:58.319 --> 29:01.197
Mmm… so are you, um,

29:01.698 --> 29:02.824
maybe falling for me?

29:02.907 --> 29:04.868
Because it's starting
to feel like you are.

29:08.079 --> 29:09.998
If so, please don't fall for me.

29:10.081 --> 29:12.125
Really,
it's making me uncomfortable, okay?

29:23.094 --> 29:24.679
What's so funny? Why are you laughing?

29:26.347 --> 29:28.224
Won-jun, you're hilarious.

29:31.436 --> 29:33.938
Ah, it's been a long time
since I've laughed.

29:36.941 --> 29:38.443
- Hey.
- Yes?

29:38.526 --> 29:42.405
I won't end up falling for you.
It's never happening, okay?

29:42.489 --> 29:44.449
Well, that was unnecessary to say.

29:46.451 --> 29:49.579
Let's just hang out.
I wanna be your friend, okay?

29:50.205 --> 29:52.582
Oh, you do? But why?

29:52.665 --> 29:54.167
Because I don't have any here.

29:56.377 --> 29:57.629
Well, uh…

29:57.712 --> 29:59.923
Oh, um, well,
the whole downstairs is all girls.

30:00.006 --> 30:01.633
You can ask one of them to be your friend.

30:01.716 --> 30:04.385
Downstairs? The entire floor is all mine.

30:05.553 --> 30:09.015
Wow, you're pretty loaded.
Now I very much wanna be your best friend.

30:09.098 --> 30:10.850
You mean it?
I can call you whenever I want?

30:10.934 --> 30:12.060
Uh, you can't, no.

30:12.143 --> 30:13.561
You're a tough nut to crack.

30:13.645 --> 30:14.771
Yes, I suppose that's true.

30:17.190 --> 30:18.983
I guess there's no hope then.

30:19.067 --> 30:22.195
If a superfan or stalker attacks me
and I die, it'll be all your fault, hmm?

30:23.112 --> 30:25.782
- Wait, but how would it be my fault?
- The sun's coming up.

30:25.865 --> 30:27.659
I have to make a wish now.
Stop bothering me.

30:27.742 --> 30:29.410
Now hold on.
Who was bothering who first?

31:28.720 --> 31:30.013
I can't.

31:31.055 --> 31:32.599
- Hey.
- Huh?

31:33.766 --> 31:34.893
You forgot your underwear.

31:35.643 --> 31:36.811
Huh? Uh…

31:48.531 --> 31:50.116
I really wish I could move out.

32:02.503 --> 32:03.338
Hmm?

32:12.889 --> 32:14.182
Kim Jin-ju!

32:14.265 --> 32:15.141
Jin-ju!

32:15.224 --> 32:17.560
- Hey, Jin-ju!
- Sorry we're late.

32:17.644 --> 32:19.103
- Let's eat.
- Is it good?

32:20.855 --> 32:22.523
Uh, what does "meh" mean?

32:26.778 --> 32:27.904
Lee Won-jun.

32:30.740 --> 32:32.283
- Hey.
- Oh.

32:32.867 --> 32:35.578
You didn't hear?
I was calling you.

32:36.162 --> 32:38.539
- I forgot to give back your scarf.
- You can hold onto that.

32:38.623 --> 32:40.541
No, it's okay. It smells like cigarettes.

32:41.459 --> 32:42.543
- Ah.
- Oh.

32:45.046 --> 32:46.798
Hey, let me take a look for you.

32:58.142 --> 32:59.519
Mmm, you got it.

33:02.855 --> 33:03.690
See you later.

33:04.315 --> 33:05.149
Mm-hmm.

33:06.609 --> 33:08.403
- Who was that? Who was that?
- What? Who?

33:08.486 --> 33:10.905
- Who is he?
- Oh, stop. Just someone I know.

33:10.989 --> 33:12.490
Too cute to just be someone.

33:12.573 --> 33:14.659
It looked like you guys
definitely had chemistry.

33:14.742 --> 33:16.619
"Just someone I know."

33:20.331 --> 33:22.375
Can't you just tell her I don't smoke?

33:22.458 --> 33:24.752
This friend I have…
Ah! No! What am I saying?

33:24.836 --> 33:26.379
This strange girl at my place…

33:27.046 --> 33:28.881
Ah, man, I don't smoke, okay?

33:30.717 --> 33:31.551
Already?

33:32.593 --> 33:33.886
She found a tutor?

33:33.970 --> 33:35.930
Ten total.
That'll be 70,000 won, please.

33:37.015 --> 33:39.100
- There you go. Thank you.
- Yes, thanks.

34:04.584 --> 34:07.378
PART-TIMERS WANTED
RECRUITING STAFF MEMBERS FOR CAFÉ 1890

34:09.213 --> 34:10.089
Hello, sir.

34:13.718 --> 34:15.428
- Take it down.
- What?

34:16.220 --> 34:17.263
You better take it down.

34:17.346 --> 34:19.474
Oh, can I not hang these flyers here?

34:19.557 --> 34:22.935
Don't you know you need a little stamp
like this, and it's not free.

34:23.019 --> 34:25.146
You think you can post stuff
without permission, huh?

34:49.378 --> 34:51.464
Tutoring? That's a piece of cake.

34:51.547 --> 34:56.177
Ladies and gentlemen,
Yangjin's top brain! Our greatest tutor!

34:56.260 --> 34:58.513
Lee Won-jun!

34:58.596 --> 34:59.514
Whoo!

35:00.640 --> 35:02.517
So I'll come visit, okay?

35:02.600 --> 35:05.645
What for? Don't forget to take
the organic pumpkin juice with you.

35:05.728 --> 35:07.355
It's in the refrigerator, okay?

35:08.981 --> 35:10.191
Hey, Won-jun!

35:10.274 --> 35:11.150
Huh?

35:11.692 --> 35:13.611
If you get a girlfriend, send pics, okay?

35:13.694 --> 35:15.488
Get back inside! It's freezing!

35:15.571 --> 35:17.782
And make sure
you take your medicine on time!

35:34.924 --> 35:35.758
Oh!

35:36.259 --> 35:40.138
MATH TUTOR

35:41.681 --> 35:42.515
Hmm?

35:46.602 --> 35:47.645
Um, yes, hello?

35:48.646 --> 35:49.772
Hello? Are you there?

35:51.357 --> 35:53.901
Hello.
I got your phone number from your flier.

35:54.652 --> 35:56.070
Yes. Yes. How can I help you?

35:56.154 --> 35:58.114
By any chance, I was wondering

35:58.197 --> 35:59.782
if you would be able to

36:01.159 --> 36:03.786
go out for a meal with me sometime?

36:05.830 --> 36:07.957
Hey!

36:08.040 --> 36:10.042
MATH TUTOR

36:22.054 --> 36:22.972
Are you still mad?

36:23.931 --> 36:24.765
Not at all.

36:24.849 --> 36:26.559
You're still mad. I can totally tell.

36:26.642 --> 36:29.812
Hey, you can be mad at me.
I wanna see what you're like.

36:30.563 --> 36:32.148
Although, I don't know why you're angry.

36:32.231 --> 36:34.692
Didn't you put the fliers up
so people would give you a call?

36:36.194 --> 36:37.028
Doona, listen.

36:38.196 --> 36:41.991
Are you, like, crazy bored or what?
Is this some kind of joke or something?

36:43.159 --> 36:46.162
You can do almost anything you want to
because you have all the money and time

36:46.245 --> 36:47.622
and don't need to work like I do.

36:47.705 --> 36:49.790
You don't have to care
about how you live your life.

36:49.874 --> 36:51.000
Congratulations.

36:51.834 --> 36:54.879
Guess what, though. Not everyone
has the same luxury as you do.

36:54.962 --> 36:57.340
I desperately need a job
and need to study hard for my career.

36:57.423 --> 36:58.466
Don't you get it?

36:58.549 --> 37:01.010
I have so much on my plate at the moment.

37:01.093 --> 37:02.762
So if you have any ounce of decency,

37:02.845 --> 37:05.932
can you just leave me alone and stop
following me around like a lost girl.

37:07.099 --> 37:10.478
I don't find any of this
the slightest bit amusing.

37:13.898 --> 37:15.441
That was disappointing. Seriously.

37:16.150 --> 37:17.360
I expected more, Won-jun.

37:17.944 --> 37:19.654
You're pretty terrible at…

37:20.154 --> 37:21.239
at getting mad, hmm?

37:21.739 --> 37:23.991
But I understand everything.

38:41.485 --> 38:42.528
Oh.

38:49.660 --> 38:50.578
Uh, hello?

38:56.959 --> 38:58.419
Miss Doona, are you here?

38:59.462 --> 39:03.507
Um… how about we get a meal
sometime in the near future?

39:03.591 --> 39:05.343
Like, um, whenever you feel like it.

39:06.135 --> 39:07.094
And I'll treat you.

39:09.138 --> 39:10.723
Well, when I get a tutoring gig.

39:16.062 --> 39:18.689
Oh jeez. My goodness.

