40:42.231 --> 40:43.315
So what are we gonna eat?

41:05.337 --> 41:07.840
Ever notice not everyone
recognizes you in public?

41:07.923 --> 41:08.799
Hmm.

41:09.633 --> 41:12.720
Dressed like I am now,
a lot of people don't recognize me at all.

41:14.180 --> 41:15.431
Remember you didn't, huh?

41:16.223 --> 41:19.268
Well, that's because, um,
it felt so divorced from reality.

41:26.984 --> 41:28.402
From now on, I'll call you.

41:29.403 --> 41:30.321
Is that all right?

41:30.905 --> 41:32.156
Well, actually,

41:32.948 --> 41:34.074
sure, if it's urgent.

41:50.925 --> 41:53.177
So listen, just in case,

41:54.178 --> 41:55.888
don't fall for me either, all right?

41:56.388 --> 41:57.223
Who, me?

41:58.933 --> 42:00.851
I don't think
that's going to be an issue at all.

42:03.812 --> 42:05.648
I guess we'll see.

42:11.070 --> 42:14.782
Life always has
its unexpected twists.

42:24.416 --> 42:25.709
You once said to me

42:26.710 --> 42:30.673
that you and I
come from two completely different worlds.

42:40.641 --> 42:43.978
That you never could've imagined
we would ever cross paths.

43:12.047 --> 43:16.010
So to find ourselves
sitting side by side was purely by chance.

43:16.093 --> 43:18.053
Or maybe even an act of destiny.

43:30.816 --> 43:31.650
RECENT CALLS

43:34.028 --> 43:36.113
LEE

43:36.196 --> 43:37.740
DOONA

43:41.035 --> 43:43.037
You may be right
that we met by chance.

43:43.120 --> 43:43.954
LEE DOONA

43:56.634 --> 43:58.177
But I'm still happy…

44:01.180 --> 44:02.640
you were the one I met.
